sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant GH as GitHub Actions
  participant SW as NOAA SWPC
  participant D as data branch
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant W as Browser
  participant M as Mail server
  GH->>SW: fetch last 7 days of X-ray flux
  GH->>GH: window, forecast, explain
  GH->>D: read alert_state.json
  GH->>GH: decide alerts (stale data refused, one per episode)
  GH->>D: push forecast.json, alerts.json, alert_state.json
  GH->>M: send e-mail (only after the push)
  W->>API: GET /api/forecast
  API->>D: fetch (cached, last good copy kept)
  API-->>W: validated payload
  W->>API: GET /api/alerts
  API-->>W: events from SQLite
  W->>W: every 10 min: reload, apply alert rules, notify if tab open
